  "notable_quotes": [
    "Pillared molecular rotation regulates adsorption, shifting these MOFs from C2H2-selective to CO2-selective separation as rotor size changes.",
    "Zn-BDC-TRZ gives excellent dynamic CO2/C2H2 separation, producing >99.5% C2H2 from a 70% feed and >99.95% from a 90% feed at 298 K.",
    "Zn-ADC-TRZ with the largest ADC rotor shows the highest C2H2-selective thermodynamic separation, including the highest heat of adsorption and IAST selectivity."
